  - m_Id: 266450740015104
    m_Localized: Normal Difficulty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 266676540370944
    m_Localized: Play until your Barista is as big as she can get, or until she gets
      angry and quits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 269021949030400
    m_Localized: Hard Difficulty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 269212714364928
    m_Localized: 'The customers are pickier and the Barista is moodier, but she can
      get even bigger this time!

      A slightly harder challenge than Normal Mode.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 269706832736256
    m_Localized: Casual Difficulty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 269928791109632
    m_Localized: 'Sometimes it''s okay to want to relax.

      Cheaper & consistent
      prices that make it easy to play around with different options.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 271100448960512
    m_Localized: Chaos Difficulty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 273385908432896
    m_Localized: 'Oh No.

      Please, for the love of all that is good in this
      world tell me you''ve at least played Normal Mode first right?  For your own
      good... please!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 274592542584832
    m_Localized: Ultra Chaos Difficulty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 274821425754112
    m_Localized: Okay this time you SERIOUSLY weren't supposed to find this.  If
      you have any self love left in your heart, don't even try this one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
