  - m_Id: 1647484102602752
    m_Localized: Welcome to the Cowtastic Cafe!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1647892887859200
    m_Localized: 'Your dairy farm has recently decided to try opening a "cow cafe"
      to help with marketing, along with that it also seems like a great way to give
      new cow girls something to do while you prepare them for dairy duty.


      Your
      first barista is excited to get started and seems full of potential, help her
      serve customers while working her towards her full milky power!


      The
      cafe is new, so you''ll also need to buy new ingredients along the way.

      Luckily
      it seems the customers around here are very receptive to the idea of paying
      extra for some on-demand fresh milk if they''re in the right mood.


      If
      you need more help while playing, there are hover-over Tooltips.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648041961811968
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648188082974720
    m_Localized: Show Again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648511212154880
    m_Localized: Congratulations!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648740309233664
    m_Localized: You've made your Barista as big as she can get!  Having reached
      her full potential she is happy to join your dairy full time, adding another
      quality cow girl to your staff!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648943238049792
    m_Localized: Keep Playing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1649079095750656
