  - m_Id: 1683534711713792
    m_Localized: 'Your dairy farm has recently decided to try opening a "cow cafe"
      to help with marketing, along with that it also seems like a great way to give
      new cow girls something to do while you prepare them for dairy duty.


      Your
      first barista is excited to get started and seems full of potential, help her
      serve customers while working her towards her full milky power!


      The
      cafe is new, so you''ll also need to buy new ingredients along the way.

      Luckily
      it seems the customers around here are very receptive to the idea of paying
      extra for some on-demand fresh milk if they''re in the right mood.


      If
      you need more help while playing, there are hover-over Tooltips.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1684438634557440
    m_Localized: Welcome to the CHAOS Cafe!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1684540275126272
    m_Localized: 'Maybe you should have stayed home today, the entire cafe is in
      chaos as all kinds of crazy stuff is going on here!  What are these prices? 
      Why do all these things keep happening every time a customer comes in?


      Hi,
      looks like you found our little easter egg, you might want to play a different
      mode first if somehow you found this on your first try.


      You''ll need
      a lot of knowledge of how the game works to overcome this chaos, or not... 
      Honestly is this even beatable?  Only one way to find out.


      Also thanks
      for playing!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
