  - m_Id: 133991633908244480
    m_Localized: Welcome to Arcade Mode's Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133992199195566080
    m_Localized: 'Having recently opened a new cafe location and having hired this
      fresh new cow girl as your first barista here, your job is to help your barista
      serve customers while making sure to keep her happy.  It''s important to make
      sure she doesn''t quit, as she seems interested in taking a promotion to a
      milkier position on your farm once she''s ready for it.


      If there''s
      anything about the gameplay that seems unclear you should hopefully be able
      to find help in this tutorial.  Otherwise you can also try jumping right in
      and start learning the game through trial and error.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133992920209006592
    m_Localized: Basics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133993158466445312
    m_Localized: 'A mouse should be everything you need to play, no other buttons
      are required.


      If there is any extra info you need for anything, Normal
      Mode has hover-over Tooltips that give plenty of useful information.

      You
      may be able to figure out most mechanics just with the Tooltip help.


      (Touch
      Controls haven''t been tested, but if you are seeing this on a phone they must
      at least partially work I guess?)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133995165042450432
    m_Localized: Drink Making
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133995531494596608
    m_Localized: 'The main task during gameplay is mixing drinks.


      Each customer
      has a portrait showing their mood and asks for an order represented by this
      graphic.


      Pay close attention to the fill amounts of each ingredient
      and what extras they want added to it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133996458540638208
    m_Localized: 'Over here are your ingredients.  While playing simply click and
      hold to start filling a cup, or for certain ingredients click once to add it
      to the drink.


      Your cafe is freshly opened and still needs to stock
      a few ingredients.  Try to earn enough to unlock them all.


      Buying new
      ingredients is important for making more money, the more complex the drink
      the higher the value.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133997655410450432
    m_Localized: 'This is the cup you are filling for your customer, while making
      drinks you can use the fill lines to compare how accurately your drink is to
      the customer''s request.


      The accuracy of the drink impacts the rating
      and how much money it sells for.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133998653654802432
    m_Localized: Managing Your Barista
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133998700043804672
    m_Localized: 'Your ultimate goal is to bring your barista to her full potential,
      but you can''t neglect her happiness while she works.  She took this job hoping
      to earn a promotion to a dairy position, but even if this is her dream job
      she wont stick around if she becomes too unhappy.


      Balance her mood
      while making progress on her size and milk production, making customers happy
      and making sure to regularly empty her will help keep her mood high.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133998785406279680
    m_Localized: 'You can keep track of your barista''s happiness and fullness here. 
      If her happiness drops to 0, she quits.


      As much as she''d like to grow,
      you can''t keep her too full all the time or else the soreness will make her
      upset, but you also shouldn''t keep her completely empty all the time or that
      may upset her as well, so try to strike a balance.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134010572390375424
    m_Localized: Serving Customers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134010918655336448
    m_Localized: 'Also try to watch for the customer''s mood, the people around here
      seem to love it when a girl looks big and full, so striking that balance for
      her size should catch the attention of customers as time goes on.


      But
      what''s the point in happy customers?  Well they might like something extra
      in their drink if their mood allows it!  A special ingredient that''s worth
      a lot of money...!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134011413927141376
    m_Localized: Timed Events
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134011680659709952
    m_Localized: 'Sometimes while playing there will be timed events that appear.


      Some
      of these events add challenge, some give you a needed break, and some are just
      a bit silly.

      Keep watch of what events are happening, and try not to
      be caught off guard by them!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134179468267331584
    m_Localized: 'While playing in arcade mode, the management button is where all
      your upgrades and customization for your barista is located.  Increasing her
      capacity and production rate can be found in there.  Along with mood boosters.


      It
      also includes a customization menu with outfit options and color options.

      Some
      customization options may need unlocked.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134179994149167104
    m_Localized: Start Game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134180089527640064
    m_Localized: Tutorial Complete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134180290938118144
    m_Localized: 'That should be about all the important information worth clarifying.

      The
      game loop should be clear, make drinks, make money, make more drinks, make
      the barista bigger, make even more money, repeat until moo.


      If you
      want a challenge, try to find clever strategies or upgrade routes to get best
      times.  If you want to enhance the fun, try unlocking some of the other outfit
      options!  Either way, enjoy your milky coffee.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
