  - m_Id: 175650030386958336
    m_Localized: New job, new life!; I hope the people here are nice.; I can't wait
      to start!; First day on the job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 175651777658507264
    m_Localized: 'Hello!; Hi there!; Welcome!; Can I get you anything?; The regular?;
      How may I help you?; What can I get yah?; Welcome! What can I get you today?;
      You look good today!; What can I bring you?; Today''s special: Fresh milk!;
      Have you tried boba milk yet?;'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 175662100285247488
    m_Localized: 'I want that cookie!; That cookie looks tasty.; I wonder how that
      cookie tastes...?; I wonder if the whole cookie will fit in my mouth?; When
      do I get the magic cookie?; This job promised certain benefits, right?; I want
      to grow...; Cookie craving incoming!; Cookie alert! I repeat, cookie alert!;
      I''ve got my eyes on that cookie!; Time to satisfy my cookie cravings!; Cookie
      mission: Activate!; Cookie radar engaged!; I''ll trade a coffee for a cookie!;
      To cookie or not to cookie? That is the question.; Resistance is futile...
      when it comes to cookies!; Cookie cravings: 100% satisfaction guaranteed!;
      Cookie time is the best time!; Cookie dreams are made of this!; Cookie anticipation
      level: Maximum!; My sweet tooth is calling for that cookie!; Cookie obsession:
      Activated!; All I want for now is that cookie!; One small step for a barista,
      one giant leap for cookie-kind!; Cookie cravings: Achieving peak levels!; I
      know you have magic for me~;'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 175662781700263936
    m_Localized: Mmm! It tastes good!~; Something feels different...?; I want more!;
      It tastes like milk!; Now we're getting somewhere!; Whoa, that feels great!;
      I wish we had more of those.; The cookie quest was worth it! Delicious!; That
      cookie hit the spot! More, please!; Cookie satisfaction achieved!; I'm in cookie
      heaven right now!; Mmm! Best decision ever!; Cookie bliss! Can't get enough!;
      This cookie is a game-changer!; Cookie magic at work! I'm loving it!; Who knew
      one cookie could bring so much joy?; Now this is what I call a cookie masterpiece!;
      Cookie paradise found!; The taste of victory... and cookies!; That cookie deserves
      a gold medal!; I'm on cloud nine with this cookie!; Milk and cookies, the perfect
      combo!; One bite, and I'm hooked! More, please!; Cookie perfection achieved!;
      Cookie magic activated! Can't stop eating!; This cookie is a taste sensation!;
      I need a lifetime supply of these cookies!; Monch Munch;
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 175663362036748288
    m_Localized: The apron is starting to feel a little tight...; Do we have a larger
      apron at the back?; I hope I can get these stains out again...; Uh oh, it's
      about to blow!; My apron can't take any more of this!; Finally!~ Just snap
      already~; I think we have a bigger apron in the back, but...; It's time.;
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 175664029996437504
    m_Localized: I feel so Full!; Please don't burst on me.; Do they slosh around?;
      They have grown so big already!; Uuuuhm, can you do something about this?;
      I've got a lot more milk than you'd think.; That's just what I can get in the
      cup.; Uh, boss... Can you help me with this?; Don't any customers want some
      of this? I'm so full...; I can't get much fuller than this...; Help? Please?;
      I feel like I'm going to burst...; I want to get big, but this is a bit uncomfortable...;
      I need a higher capacity before I can stay this full for long...; Gah! Just
      milk me already!; Milk me! Milk me! Please!; If this wasn't so uncomfortable,
      I'd love this...; I don't mind if they watch, just empty me please...; I'm
      feeling so swollen!; I hope I don't overflow!; Feeling like a milk-filled balloon!;
      I'm afraid to move too much!; Overflow imminent! SOS!; My cups runneth over,
      quite literally...; Do you think anyone would notice if I leaked?; I need to
      relieve some pressure, fast!; Feeling like a milk factory on overdrive!; Can't
      focus with all this milk sloshing around!; Feels like they're about to burst
      out of my chest!; Help me out here, they're reaching critical mass!; Is this
      what they mean by 'milked to perfection'?; Feels like I'm carrying a dairy
      farm!; Overflow warning! Danger, danger!; I'm a milk volcano ready to erupt!;
      Can't focus with this milky distraction!; Just need to find a way to release
      all this milk!; These milk jugs are ready to explode!; I'm going to explode.;
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 175664836233940992
    m_Localized: Time for an upgrade, perhaps?; Investing in upgrades sounds like
      a plan!; Let's see what upgrades are available.; It might be time to level
      up our operations.; Enhancing our business could be beneficial.; I wonder if
      there are any worthwhile upgrades.; Considering some upgrades for our cafe.;
      Exploring upgrade options seems like a good idea.; Let's boost our efficiency
      with some upgrades!; Upgrades could give us an edge in the market.; Should
      we buy something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 175666128926822400
    m_Localized: That's it, I quit!; Worst boss ever... I'm out of here.; I'm way
      too sore to work, bye...; I'm done dealing with this chaos! I quit!; I can't
      take it anymore! I'm leaving!; I deserve better than this! I'm out!; This job
      is not worth the stress. I'm done!; No amount of coffee is worth this hassle.
      I'm gone!; I've had enough! Time to find a better opportunity.; I refuse to
      work under these conditions. I quit!; Life's too short for this nonsense. I'm
      leaving.; Sorry, but I'm done playing barista. I'm outta here!; I didn't sign
      up for this! I quit!; Forget this, I'm going home.;
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
