  - m_Id: 182205256204046336
    m_Localized: Be careful, it's still a bit hot!; Here! It's a little special,
      just for you!; Is this correct?; Order up!~; Enjoy your drink!; I hope you
      like it.; Here you go, have a great day!; There you go, come back soon!~; Voila!
      Your customized creation, just for you!; I put a little extra love into this
      one, enjoy!; Here's your beverage, made with care!; Your order, served with
      a smile!; May this drink bring a little joy to your day!; Perfection in a cup,
      just for you!; Enjoy your sip of happiness!; Your drink awaits! Sip and savor!;
      Crafted with care, just for you!; Your order is ready, enjoy the flavor!; Here's
      your beverage, made to perfection!; I hope this drink makes your day a little
      brighter!; Indulge in this little delight, it's all yours!; Savor the flavor!
      It's brewed just for you!; Here you go! Drink up and enjoy!; Your perfect cup,
      served with a smile!; Take a sip and let the world melt away!; I hope this
      drink exceeds your expectations!; May your day be as delightful as this drink!;
      Sip, savor, and enjoy! It's made just for you!; Here it is, should be just
