  - m_Id: 219427953908404224
    m_Localized: Growing bigger isn't worth it if the job's this bad...; Angry cows
      are usually to blame for the sour milk.; I've had just enough of working here!;
      Ugh!  I'm about to quit!; This job is terrible!; I want to go home...; I don't
      get paid enough for this...; Uuugh...; This job better improve soon...; You'd
      better let me take a break.; I'm having a bad day...; Please squeeze me or
      something...; I just wanted to be a dairy cow...; Moo...; I can't keep up with
      this workload...; I feel like I'm at my breaking point...; Is it time to clock
      out yet?; Every day feels like a struggle...; I'm running on fumes here...;
      I'm so tired of this routine...; Feels like I'm stuck in a rut...; I can barely
      keep my eyes open...; Will this shift ever end?; Just gotta push through another
      day...; I need a vacation... or a miracle.; Wishing for a ray of sunshine in
      this gloom...; Can't shake off this feeling of exhaustion...; I'm starting
      to lose my motivation...; Everything just seems so overwhelming...; I'm not
      sure how much longer I can keep this up...; Just trying to survive the day...;
      This job is sucking the life out of me...; Feeling like I'm stuck in a never-ending
      cycle...; I'm so drained... emotionally and physically.; Hoping for a change
      in luck... and mood.; Just counting down the minutes until I can leave...;
      I'm so close to calling it quits...; I feel like I'm hitting rock bottom...;
      I just want to crawl into bed and never come out...; Feels like I'm running
      on empty...; I'm in desperate need of a pick-me-up...; Just gotta keep putting
      one foot in front of the other...; Wishing for a spark of energy to get me
      through...; Is it too much to ask for a little break?; Maybe I'd tell some
      jokes if I were in a better moo'd.;
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 219427974720540672
    m_Localized: "Is this job always this hard?; Spoiler alert! The milk's gone off.;
      I hope it doesn't rain this afternoon.; I need a break...; The right coffee
      in the wrong milk can make all the difference in the cup.; Keep it together
      Barbra, the benefits are worth it...; Bleh...; This is tiring.; I wish this
      job was a little nicer.; This place is really busy, isn't it?; I need to restock
      the supplies.; Can I take a break?; There's so much work to do!; Can I have
      a snack?; Breath in\u2026 Breath out...; This isn't too different from my last
      job.; I could use a little more attention.; Moo...?; I'm feeling a bit overwhelmed
      today.; I hope things get easier soon...; Just trying to keep my head above
      water...; Is it just me or is today dragging on forever?; Feeling a little
      burnt out...; Trying to stay positive, but it's tough...; I need a breather...
      this job can be exhausting.; I wish I could catch a break...; This workload
