      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 219427987508973568
    m_Localized: I wonder what Lacti is up to?; Do we have a few more cups in the
      back?; The spoiled milk always got what it wanted.; There's a lot going on
      today.; A man attacked me with cream, butter and milk. How dairy.; I used to
      be a cow like you, until I took a bottle to the breast.; I'm feeling productive.;
      Can you grab me some more coffee from the back?; The coffee smells so nice.;
      The customers keep rolling in.; Do you think they like me?; Normal day at the
      job.; There we go, counter's all clean again.; I can get kinda moody when I'm
      tired.; I could always use more attention, if you'd like.; How do I use the
      coffee machine again?; Do we even need to sell regular milk?; Feeling pretty
      good about today!; Looks like it's shaping up to be a great day!; I'm on top
      of things today!; Feeling energized and ready to tackle anything!; I'm loving
      the vibe in the cafe today!; It's a pleasure to work in such a lovely environment!;
      Happiness is contagious, isn't it?; Ready to make some delicious drinks!; I'm
      feeling pretty chipper today!; Let's keep the good vibes flowing!; Feeling
      like I can handle anything that comes my way!; Everything seems brighter when
      I'm in a good mood!; I've got a smile on my face and coffee in my hand!; The
      coffee tastes even better when I'm happy!; I'm like a ray of sunshine today!;
      Today's looking like a great day to make some coffee!; I'm in my element when
      I'm in a good mood!; Ready to spread some happiness, one cup at a time!; Feeling
      cheerful and ready to take on the day!; Happiness is the secret ingredient
      in every drink!; Moo...?; Wait, its not normal for coffee and sugar to make
      a cowgirl grow?;
