  - m_Id: 219428000616173568
    m_Localized: I hope Lacti escapes work to see me here today.; My friend is always
      trying to scare her other friends. She's a fan of milkshakes.; My friend thinks
      she produces almond milk. She must be nuts.; How are you feeling, boss?; Want
      to go somewhere after work today?; This job is surprisingly fun!; Anything
      I can do for you?; The customers seem to like me.; Hmm hm hmm hhm hmmm!~; What
      a nice day!; Watch this trick I can do with the cups.; You've been a great
      boss.; Mood swings?  Not if you keep treating me this well!; Cows can get kinda
      MOOdy if they aren't treated as well as you treat me~.; I feel like I'm on
      top of the world today!; Isn't it nice to have a job that makes you smile?;
      Feeling so content and happy right now!; Every day feels like a good day when
