  - m_Id: 219428017326280704
    m_Localized: 'I''m feeling great!; Cow to the milk: ''I am your mother''.; My
      dad landed a new job at the dairy. He''s the cow-ordinator.; I introduced chocolate
      to milk. They did a chocolate milkshake.; The milk didn''t like my last joke.
      He wasn''t a-moo-sed.; I love this job!; Can my day even get any better?; The
      customers are being very nice to me today.; Want to go with me for drinks later?;
      We''re doing great!~; Eeee!~; Ahaha!~; Mooo!~; Wanna give me a squeeze?; I''ll
      make sure to save extra milk for you later!~; I''m practically floating on
      air!; I''ve got a smile that won''t quit!; Today''s so good, it feels like
      a dream!; Is this what pure happiness feels like? It''s amazing!; I''m radiating
      positivity and joy!; Feeling like I''m on cloud nine today!; My heart is bursting
      with happiness!; I''m so happy, I could burst into song!; Grinning from ear
      to ear today!; Today feels like a perfect day!; I''m filled to the brim with
      joy and laughter!; I''m living my best life right now!; Feeling like the luckiest
      barista in the world!; Today''s so wonderful, I want to remember it forever!;
      Can you feel the happiness radiating from me?; Feeling like I''ve won the happiness
      lottery today!; I''m overflowing with happiness!; Every moment today feels
      like a gift!; I''m so grateful for all the happiness in my life!; I''m bursting
      with sunshine and rainbows today!; I feel like I could conquer the world with
      this happiness!; Life is a beautiful melody and today I''m dancing to the happiest
      tune!; I''m positively beaming with joy!; Today feels like a fairytale come
      true!; I''m spreading happiness like confetti today!; I feel like I''m wrapped
      in a warm, fuzzy blanket of happiness!; I''m so happy, I could hug the entire
      world!; Today''s happiness level: off the charts!; I''m radiating so much happiness,
      I might just cause a joy overload!; I''ve got enough happiness to light up
      the whole city!; I''m so thrilled, I could do a happy dance right here, right
      now!; Today feels like a dream I never want to wake up from!; I''m so filled
      with joy, it''s like every day is my birthday!; I''m positively buzzing with
      happiness today!; Moo!;'
