  - m_Id: 219428063652368384
    m_Localized: "I feel so small; You promised to help me grow, right?; Still waiting
      for those special benefits to kick in...; Can you buy me something?; We can
      always do better.; I can barely feel their weight yet.; I wonder if I\u2019ll
      be as big as the other cow girls."
