  - m_Id: 219428070547804160
    m_Localized: "Now we\u2019re starting to make good progress; This is only the
      beginning; Now I\u2019m starting to feel some nice weight on me; Let\u2019s
      keep the milk flowing!; This job has some great perks; You said you own a farm
      too, right?; Do you have any lotion?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 219428089740939264
    m_Localized: "This is getting out of hand, and I\u2019m all for it!; I wasn't
      able to milk yesterday. It was an udder failure; I love milk when it's churned.
      It's butter that way; More!; Bigger!; We can always go bigger!; My back is
      extremely strong, I can carry these no problem!; If only I could get as meaty
      as I can get milky; The customers really seem to like me; These wonders can
      do more than make milk; I\u2019m one of your best girls yet? You flatter me!;
      I can\u2019t wait to meet the other cow girls."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 219428109055709184
    m_Localized: "I get promoted when I\u2019m too big to serve drinks, right?; Do
      you get a milkshake if I jump on a pogostick?; I have to give Mewth some milk
      later...; The customers are looking at me strangely today... do I have something
