      to greatness!; I\u2019m overflowing with power! And milk; More! More!; Please!
      Just a bit bigger!; Even I can\u2019t handle much bigger; I can\u2019t wait
      to sell my own brand of milk~; Bigger! Bigger!~; This milk flow will never
      end!; The end is near; First the cafe, then the world!; I hope I get city size
      in the sequel; Lacti will be so jealous; Praise the Milk!; I get to be milked
      this much every day? Life is bliss."
